sections.wikitext:
*The title of the episode refers to the ''[[wikipedia:Divine Comedy|Divine Comedy]]'', a 14th-century epic poem by Italian writer [[wikipedia:Dante Alighieri|Dante Alighieri]].
**The original Italian title of the episode, "'''L'Inferno Di Dante'''", refers to the first part of Dante's ''Divine Comedy'' called the "[[wikipedia:Inferno_(Dante)|Inferno]]".
*Story supervisor Maurizio de Angelis has stated that this is his favorite episode of the show. {{Extsource|1=https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=AjYWmvnOqQo&list=PL6NZlSvyFyQU-o6alH6pXfEqPNXEBFSQo|2=YouTube}}
